anèse (<span class=\"m\">Z=25</span>)</li><li><span class=\"num\">45</span> cobalt (<span class=\"m\">Z=27</span>)</li><li><span class=\"num\">46</span> fluor (<span class=\"m\">Z=9</span>)</li><li><span class=\"num\">47</span> oxygène (<span class=\"m\">Z=8</span>)</li><li><span class=\"num\">48</span> fer (<span class=\"m\">Z=26</span>)</li><li><span class=\"num\">49</span> béryllium (<span class=\"m\">Z=4</span>)</li><li><span class=\"num\">50</span> calcium (<span class=\"m\">Z=20</span>)</li><li><span class=\"num\">51</span> germanium (<span class=\"m\">Z=32</span>)</li><li><span class=\"num\">52</span> rubidium (<span class=\"m\">Z=37</span>)</li><li><span class=\"num\">53</span> néon (<span class=\"m\">Z=10</span>)</li><li><span class=\"num\">54</span> sélénium (<span class=\"m\">Z=34</span>)</li><li><span class=\"num\">55</span> scandium (<span class=\"m\">Z=21</span>)</li><li><span class=\"num\">56</span> brome (<span class=\"m\">Z=35</span>)</li></ul> </div> ","corrige":"<p class=\"q\">Configurations :</p><ul class=\"en\"><li><span class=\"num\">33</span> <span class=\"ce\">Sr</span> : <span class=\"m\">1s<sup>2</sup> 2s<sup>2</sup> 2p<sup>6</sup> 3s<sup>2</sup> 3p<sup>6</sup> 4s<sup>2</sup> 3d<sup>10</sup> 4p<sup>6</sup> 5s<sup>2</sup></span>, soit <span class=\"m\">[<span class=\"ce\">Kr</span>] 5s<sup>2</sup></span> ; 2 électron(s) de valence ; bloc s, période 5, colonne 2</li><li><span class=\"num\">34</span> <span class=\"ce\">Mg</span> : <span class=\"m\">1s<sup>2</sup> 2s<sup>2</sup> 2p<sup>6</sup> 3s<sup>2</sup></span>, soit <span class=\"m\">[<span class=\"ce\">Ne</span>] 3s<sup>2</sup></span> ; 2 électron(s) de valence ; bloc s, période 3, colonne 2</li><li><span class=\"num\">35</span> <span class=\"ce\">C</span> : <span class=\"m\">1s<sup>2</sup> 2s<sup>2</sup> 2p<sup>2</sup></span>, soit <span class=\"m\">[<span class=\"ce\">He</span>] 2s<sup>2</sup> 2p<sup>2</sup></span> ; 4 électron(s) de valence ; bloc p, période 2, colonne 14</li><li><span